Becoming.LumpedSeeking.Agree.ties : Becoming.LumpedSeeking.Tied Becoming.LumpedSeeking.Agree.agreeing
  Becoming.LumpedSeeking.Agree.Bias.heads Becoming.LumpedSeeking.Agree.Bias.tails
